<title>USA: American Coin Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>American Coin Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						    Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							  March 31,</p>
<p>					    1997			1996</p>
<p> Revenues			     $12,357		   $8,014</p>
<p> Net earnings			     881			503</p>
<p> Net earnings per share		0.16		     0.09</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	 5,425		    5,449</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said in Q1 1997 it reached a three-year agreement with Safeway Inc to provide domestic skill-cranes.</p>
<p>Full name is American Coin Merchandising Inc.</p>
</text>
